    <!-- Featured Podcast -->
    <section class="featured-podcast">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="podcast-card featured">
                <div class="podcast-header">
                    <h2>Straight to the Money Podcast</h2>
                    <p class="podcast-host">Host & Creator</p>
                </div>
                <div class="podcast-description">
                    <p>A deep-dive podcast focused on real estate, investing, business strategy, and the entrepreneurial journey. Each episode explores actionable insights, market trends, and strategies for building wealth through real estate and smart business decisions.</p>

                    <h3>What You'll Learn:</h3>
                    <ul class="podcast-features">
                        <li>Real estate investment strategies and trends</li>
                        <li>Business and entrepreneurial insights</li>
                        <li>Market analysis and forecasting</li>
                        <li>Personal finance and wealth building</li>
                        <li>Success stories and case studies</li>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="podcast-cta">
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@StraightToTheMoney" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Listen Now</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Investor Fuel -->
    <section class="investor-fuel">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="podcast-card">
                <div class="podcast-header">
                    <h2>Investor Fuel</h2>
                    <p class="podcast-host">Featured Contributor | 400+ Episodes</p>
                </div>
                <div class="podcast-description">
                    <p>A premier podcast for real estate investors featuring interviews with successful investors, entrepreneurs, and thought leaders. With over 400 episodes, Investor Fuel is the go-to resource for anyone serious about real estate investing and wealth creation.</p>

                    <h3>Featured Topics:</h3>
                    <ul class="podcast-features">
                        <li>Real estate investment strategies</li>
                        <li>Deal analysis and valuation</li>
                        <li>Building successful teams</li>
                        <li>Market trends and forecasting</li>
                        <li>Scaling from deals to businesses</li>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="podcast-cta">
                        <a href="https://investorfuel.com/real-estate-pros/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Investor Fuel</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why Podcasting -->
    <section class="why-podcasting">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Why I Host & Appear on Podcasts</h2>
            <p>Podcasting allows me to share knowledge, insights, and perspectives that help real estate professionals, investors, and entrepreneurs make better decisions. Whether I'm hosting Straight to the Money or appearing on Investor Fuel, my goal is always the same: provide actionable insights that move the needle.</p>

            <div class="why-grid">
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>Share Knowledge</h3>
                    <p>Real estate and investing expertise that comes from years of hands-on experience and continuous learning.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>Build Community</h3>
                    <p>Connect with fellow investors, entrepreneurs, and professionals who are serious about growth and success.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>Stay Current</h3>
                    <p>Keep up with market trends, investment strategies, and emerging opportunities in real estate.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card">
                    <h3>Thought Leadership</h3>
                    <p>Establish credibility and share perspectives that help shape the industry conversation.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

